         TRANS 7,1,OPT=(DEFER,AMODE31) ENQUEUE ON SEGMENT      XA0045DK         
./ R 01066000          $ 01066100 100                                           
         BO    SHRDROP        YES -- DROP OUR COPY OF IT       XA0045DK         
./ R 01071000          $ 01071100 100                                           
         TRANS 7,1,OPT=(DEFER,AMODE31) ENQUEUE ON PAGE         XA0045DK         
./ R 01248000          $ 01248010 010                                           
         B     RELEXIT        RETURN TO CALLER                 XA0045DK         
SHRDROP  TM    SAVEWRK1,PARTIAL KEEP THE NAMED SYSTEM?         XA0045DK         
         BO    NEXTPAGE       YES                              XA0045DK         
         MVC   PAGPFRA,=A(PAGINVW) OUR COPY OF THE MODEL PTE   XA0045DK         
         XC    SWPFLAG(8),SWPFLAG AND OF ITS SWAP ENTRY        XA0045DK         
*  LEAVE A FRESH ZERO-PAGE ENTRY, AS DMKBLDRT MAKES THEM: A    XA0045DK         
*  SWAP ENTRY WITH NEITHER SWPRECMP NOR A DASD SLOT IS ONE     XA0045DK         
*  DMKPGTPR ABENDS ON (PGT005) -- DMKPGSPO RESCANS (REPEAT).   XA0045DK         
         MVI   SWPFLAG,SWPRECMP ZERO PAGE, NOTHING TO RELEASE  XA0045DK         
         LR    R0,R1          THE VIRTUAL ADDRESS              XA0045DK         
         SRL   R0,12          ITS PAGE NUMBER                  XA0045DK         
         STC   R0,SWPVPAGE    WITHIN THE SEGMENT               XA0045DK         
         OI    VMESTAT,VMINVPAG THE TLB MAY HOLD IT            XA0045DK         
         OI    APSTAT2,CPPTLBR ...                             XA0045DK         
         B     NEXTPAGE       NOT OURS TO FREE                 XA0045DK         
